  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里究竟是什么地方……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“联谊咖啡厅”终成眷属……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 08 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 13 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}呜……\n疼死了，该死……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……啊？\n这里是哪儿？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:2:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}气氛跟刚才不一样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……搞什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}……白痴吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}喂，你是不是搞错了什么。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}没看见我们都是男的吗？\n怎么会是什么命定伴侣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}啧……根本不听人说话。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……真是的，虽然搞不清状况，\n也只能往前走了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}和那帮家伙走散了啊……\n你也很担心吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}当然{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}倒也没有{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:11:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}“也”？{F5 47 02 01 02 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}当队长可真不容易。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}别光顾着照顾别人，\n把自己累倒了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}是信任他们的意思？\n真不坦率啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}……多少会有点担心吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}不过，那帮家伙，\n不管遇上什么阴影应该都没事……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_304.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}那就往前看看吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
